# P2 (shimmer) swept from 0 to 255 at a long size on a 220 Hz saw: a plain reverb, then the octave fades in above the
# tail, then the cascade climbs. The shifter runs at every setting, so nothing clicks where it starts.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 3
track fx1
input saw 220 0.4
preset 200 0 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p2 0 255 4 44
gain 1
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below -3
